   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "How it flows\n\n\u2460 Pet appears\nClaude Desktop starts the MCP server\n\u2192 it launches IdlePaws.app\n\u2192 WindowTracker finds Claude's window\n\u2192 InputBarLocator finds the Prompt box\n\u2192 Overlay draws the pet standing on it\n\n\u2461 \"Play games\" button\ndouble-click pet \u2192 console \u2192 Play\n\u2192 BrowserPaneOpener clicks Claude's\n   Browser button, types localhost:4747\n\u2192 HTTPServer serves the games\n\n\u2462 You ask Claude \"open game\"\nClaude calls open_game tool \u2192 gets URL\n\u2192 Claude opens it in its browser pane\n\n\u2463 Claude Code session ends\nStop hook \u2192 hook.js \u2192 socket \"react\"\n\u2192 pet hops: \"Done! \u00b7 project\"\n\n\u2464 Shutdown\nClaude quits, or no MCP server\nconnected for 20s \u2192 app exits",
   "originalText": "How it flows\n\n\u2460 Pet appears\nClaude Desktop starts the MCP server\n\u2192 it launches IdlePaws.app\n\u2192 WindowTracker finds Claude's window\n\u2192 InputBarLocator finds the Prompt box\n\u2192 Overlay draws the pet standing on it\n\n\u2461 \"Play games\" button\ndouble-click pet \u2192 console \u2192 Play\n\u2192 BrowserPaneOpener clicks Claude's\n   Browser button, types localhost:4747\n\u2192 HTTPServer serves the games\n\n\u2462 You ask Claude \"open game\"\nClaude calls open_game tool \u2192 gets URL\n\u2192 Claude opens it in its browser pane\n\n\u2463 Claude Code session ends\nStop hook \u2192 hook.js \u2192 socket \"react\"\n\u2192 pet hops: \"Done! \u00b7 project\"\n\n\u2464 Shutdown\nClaude quits, or no MCP server\nconnected for 20s \u2192 app exits",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
